Upstream-Name: libghostty-gtk
Source: https://github.com/arsfeld/libghostty-gtk
Comment: libghostty-gtk-1.so links libghostty-vt 1.0.0 statically, and with
 it the libraries libghostty-vt's release builds in: Highway, simdutf and
 uucode. None of those are in this source tree (debian/README.source); their
 notices follow, as their licenses require.
